## 🔥 Agni Series

Agni Missile Series

Purpose:

* Long-range ballistic missiles
* Strategic deterrence

Examples:

* Agni-I
* Agni-II
* Agni-III
* Agni-IV
* Agni-V

---

## 🔥 Prithvi

Prithvi Missile

Purpose:

* Surface-to-surface missile
* Short-range strike capability

---

## 🔥 BrahMos

BrahMos

Purpose:

* Supersonic cruise missile
* One of the fastest operational cruise missiles

Key Fact:
👉 Jointly developed by India and Russia.

---

## 🔥 Akash

Akash Missile

Purpose:

* Air defence
* Targets enemy aircraft and drones

