# 🎤 Common SSB Interview Questions

### Q1

What is BrahMos?

👉 A supersonic cruise missile jointly developed by India and Russia.

---

### Q2

Name one indigenous Indian fighter aircraft.

👉 Tejas

---

### Q3

What is the role of an aircraft carrier?

👉 It acts as a floating airbase and projects naval power.

---

### Q4

What is India's first indigenous aircraft carrier?

👉 INS Vikrant

---

### Q5

What is nuclear triad?

👉 Ability to launch nuclear weapons from land, air and sea.

